### Create a new habit completion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "habitId": 1,
  "completionDate": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "done": true,
  "note": "Completed morning workout"
}

### Get all completions for a habit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/habit/1?userId=1

### Get completions for a habit within date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/habit/1/range?userId=1&startDate=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-01-31T23:59:59Z

### Get a specific completion by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/1?userId=1

### Update a habit completion
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/1?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "habitId": 1,
  "completionDate": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z",
  "done": true,
  "note": "Updated: Completed morning workout with extra cardio"
}

### Delete a habit completion
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/1?userId=1

### Get completion count for a habit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/habit-completions/habit/1/count?userId=1